@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/visites
@clientToken = <client-jwt>
@adminToken = <admin-jwt>

### Create visite request (CLIENT)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "annonceId": 1,
  "dateVisite": "2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "commentaire": "Je souhaite visiter cet appartement."
}

### List client visites
GET {{baseUrl}}/client?page=0&size=10&statut=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### List all visites (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?page=0&size=20&statut=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update visite status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "statut": "CONFIRMED",
  "commentaire": "Visite confirmée par l'agent."
}

### Update visite date
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/date
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "dateVisite": "2026-12-02T14:00:00",
  "commentaire": "Nouvelle date validée."
}

### Cancel visite (CLIENT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
